# Generated by scripts/make_jsonld.py from fhp_linkml.yml; do not edit.
# Draft FHP vocabulary for released FHP 1.0 (FHP-Specification issue #4, follow-up
# F-01 of specs/006-protein-header). Runtime reader/writer support is coordinated
# with FAIR-bioHeaders-Tools#58; publication with
# FAIR-bioHeaders-Specification#107.
# Canonical URL: https://raw.githubusercontent.com/FAIR-bioHeaders/FHP-Specification/main/jsonld/fhp.terms.ttl
# Release copies: https://w3id.org/fair-bioheaders/fhp/vX.Y.Z/jsonld/fhp.terms.ttl
# Shared vocabulary pin: FAIR-bioHeaders-Specification v0.4.0
#   release commit: 84c2f90ab0e97c81d8afbf33eafe80ebade7a009
